direct-tell
owner: fable-5.1 session 53f400ad
started: 2026-09-16
what: the operator's ask: `w.tell` inside a direct block as the mark on
  the Writer operation `Writer(w)`, typed Unit so it reads as a
  statement and trips no -Wall unused-value warning (a bare
  `Writer(w)` statement does, E176, though it runs by do-notation).
  An inline extension in object Direct; the macro must see the mark
  through the inliner's proxy bindings for a non-trivial argument.
files: src/main/scala/Direct.scala, src/test/scala/TestDirect.scala, docs/direct-style.md, CHANGELOG.md
